about:
Skillful, results-oriented project manager with over 10 years experience directing and contributing to sophisticated projects within telecommunications industry.

Core Competencies:
•	Excellent project management skills; 
•	Proven record of executing complex programs/projects from initiation to deployment;
•	Developing and administering budgets, schedules and performance objectives;
•	Experience with tools and methods for project management and quality control;
•	Customer-focused optimal business process design, development and implementation; 
•	Ability to manage and motivate distributed and cross-functional teams;
•	Self-starter with excellent problem solving skills; 
•	Ability to deliver results under stress;
•	Excellent communication and analytical skills.

Specialties: project management, program management, change management, process improvement, service assurance, telecommunications, technology, business development, strategic planning & leadership, profit growth, executive management, finance & budgeting, operations management, business process

experience.description:
Prepared, successfully tested and launched new product within broadband Internet line of business. Managed a cross-functional task force of twenty people to deliver the project on time and within a budget.

•	Managed commercial service module of «Home MTS Connect» national project as part of developing broadband Internet line of business;
•	Developed and managed project plan. Established key tasks, deliverables and timelines to deliver the project on time and within the budget; 
•	Monitored progress and communicated status updates to senior management on a weekly basis;
•	Defined and developed detailed specifications for business processes necessary to support sales, service delivery and billing for end consumers; 
•	Defined  changes necessary to the IT systems to support new product (i.e. billing, OSS/BSS systems);
•	Developed and implemented service delivery strategy (defined departments involved, Call Center specifications, tech support, etc.);
•	Designed Service Assurance policies and procedures to guarantee optimal subscriber experience; 
•	Developed project's marketing strategy based on industry's competitive analysis. Presented recommendation and got final approval from executive committee;  
•	Coordinated with sales, subscription services and tech support departments to ensure accurate understanding and implementation of business processes. Designed training materials and monitored training schedules and quality;

projects.description:
Tumor identification from MRI scan image of brain; 
- Application of c-means clustering and naive Bayes classification segregated and filtered the image into sections (based on pixel densities), from where tumor cells were identified. 
- Improved accuracy in tumor identification by 18%.
